# Supabase (IronSight)

- Default environment is **local Supabase**. Never connect to production.
- Use hosted `agent-sandbox` only when the task explicitly requires hosted integration testing.
- Treat migrations as versioned code. Never apply production migrations automatically.
- Never silently modify database schema.
- When creating or changing a migration:
  - Name the migration file clearly
  - State whether it was for local Supabase or hosted `agent-sandbox`
  - Review the SQL; test locally
  - Remind the user to review and apply production migrations manually
- Keep least privilege and tenant/user scoping on every data operation.
- Never bypass RLS, auth, or environment restrictions.
- Never expose secrets from `.env`, service role keys, or connection strings.
